stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> queued : run created
  queued --> running : scheduler claimed
  running --> paused : approval or restart interruption
  paused --> running : resume
  running --> succeeded : output node completed
  running --> failed : unrecoverable step failure
  running --> cancelled : cancel requested
  paused --> cancelled : cancel requested
  failed --> running : retry from failed step
  succeeded --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]
